{"id":"7d25bb2329978947","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Macneille Closure","display":"df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure — ZFC Order12 Macneille Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure — ZFC Order12 Macneille Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-closure.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-macneille-closure — ZFC Order12 Macneille Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9c027eec7ccac7b\" href=\"?note=e9c027eec7ccac7b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-closure.md\">../batch18/58-df-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq P\">\\(M\\subseteq P\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MacneilleClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MacneilleClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}macneille\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MacneilleClosure}_S(M;A;P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nM=\n\\left\\{x\\in P:\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\n\\left((\\forall a\\in A\\;a\\leq_P u)\\to x\\leq_P u\\right)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}macneille\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12MacneilleClosure}_S(M;A;P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land A\\subseteq P\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nM=\n\\left\\{x\\in P:\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\n\\left((\\forall a\\in A\\;a\\leq_P u)\\to x\\leq_P u\\right)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed set is the lower cone of the upper cone of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, with both\ncone operations expanded in the ambient partial order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAn